qKAHuGK02u9_zHRH6sLdBBQQ-CdgPgWu5UwD6SbG2gG9fmYg5Jh-srV8eB_Kbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNa2cihdbHxaDp0L58VaTHXFDpKDaDKhtnX4K8R40AN5A&oe=6AC8F2D7"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=59n5kaDp-KQQ7kNvwFcBJVR&_nc_oc=Adrslzzr6cZ46sfnbZe1WUqUkXg0lKO-ewGNLy7hLn0sbVUuB3DbqhVHsg3VqKX2oeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPwZPvn-wc9y7uk6RZ6VrYU7rCUlQBGokESAlD5waT-Mg&oe=6AC8F0E1"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z4U8ZCZPkhEQ7kNvwE5dWvf&_nc_oc=Adr76p9-L5URu8zSlgZR-l0P6U2_XiNR6aVf6J7kCPlT1pB2PAIZVROdlCXFrjaUefE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMj8l3OLdpLuLdjklwc_ff4n7X6OV15UU6qwYN-9r0hhQ&oe=6AC91757"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4FF_hOfMSvUQ7kNvwHSXznH&_nc_oc=AdrolFj3v6C0Dqbs9guqRofu7FXx6IbNLOoLigXSroq2rrWgfT_OKhfkPwrdY0kb6uc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP2v54rNWa_5uUdQ6DurvxGSjwUI1hYs8OF_kQvJ2LldQ&oe=6AC8E5A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uYfL-hqSyUMQ7kNvwF-0mcM&_nc_oc=Adr2a_qhk_G55-GFOVqGTEZ9GUnPsApJoHOnPDhspvlcpvYHBJ_jVUu1R_uca_xjAX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM_Rq1b7wtaH2i5t11RGZ1UtSnXMM9qnESc7dT2z_-2WQ&oe=6AC90A2E"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null